# Build output. Every binary and every release archive `make` produces lands
# under build/, including build/dist, so the one rule covers all of it.
/build/

# Compiled test binaries, from `go test -c`.
*.test

# The release notes the release workflow cuts out of CHANGELOG.md. It is a
# derived copy of a section of a tracked file, and it lands here when the same
# command is run by hand to check what a tag would publish.
/release-notes.md

# A WebAssembly module left at the root by a `GOOS=js` build. The page used to
# run the emulator itself; that path and its cmd/wasm entry point are gone, so
# a module here is a leftover rather than a build product.
/wasm
*.wasm

# Coverage and profile output. The CLI's -profile, -profile-folded and -diag
# take a path of the caller's choosing — write those under var/ — so these are
# only the conventional names that land where they are run.
coverage.out
*.prof
*.pprof

# The runtime tree. Game archives are not ours to publish, saves belong to
# whoever played, and a debug run's reports are that run's alone. var/README.md
# explains the layout and is not ignored.
/var/games/
/var/savedata/
/var/logs/
# What ./start.sh wrote down about the server it started: its pid and its log.
/var/run/
# Scripted ways back to a scene. A route is written against one archive and is
# usually named after it, so it belongs beside the archives rather than in Git.
/var/routes/
# Custom Patch Folder
/var/custom/

# Secrets, at any depth rather than only the root file that exists today.
.env
.env.*

# Local-only state: a Go workspace points this module somewhere else on one
# machine, and the rest is per-editor or per-tool.
go.work
go.work.sum
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
**/node_modules/

# The socket launchers. They are ./start.sh and ./stop.sh for one deployment's
# Unix socket, and the path in them is that deployment's rather than this
# repository's; the tracked scripts stay the ones written for a port.
run/
/sstart.sh
/sstop.sh

# Working notes rather than documentation.
TODO.md
# Should be temporarily banned
AGENTS.md

.DS_Store
